      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  45 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Grab the opponent before verociously attacking them. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your Unarmed Strike Damage Die + 4d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> and leaves the target <em>Prone</em> on a hit.</p>\n<p>If you have the <em>Enraged Condition</em> this <strong>Technique</strong> has Advantage.</p>\n",
